==Description==
For use in the ==External links== section.

*Official links have parameters  to keep sources organized.
*Unofficial links have parameters  leading to other sources.

==Parameters==
===Official===
{{t|Official}}
; <code>web    =</code>
: URLs that lead to official social accounts or websites of a producer.
; <code>media  =</code>
: URLs that lead to official playlists or illustrated media of a producer.
; <code>prchs  =</code>
: URLs that lead to official purchases of media.
; <code>dwlds  =</code>
: URLs that lead to official downloads of media or package contents.
; <code>url    =</code>
: URLs that lead to official miscellaneous content such as lyrics- if not packaged within downloads.

===Unofficial===
{{t|Unofficial}}
; <code>hmiku    =</code>
: [http://w.atwiki.jp/hmiku/ Hatsune Miku wiki] (初音ミク Wiki)  &nbsp;requires the ending url number. 
: <code>http://w.atwiki.jp/hmiku/pages/<u>20</u>.html</code>

; <code>nico  =</code>
: [http://dic.nicovideo.jp/ Niconico Encyclopedia] (ニコニコ大百科)  &nbsp;requires the ending url number for a nico video.
: <code>http://dic.nicovideo.jp/v/<u>sm1097445</u></code>

; <code>nico2  =</code>
: [http://dic.nicovideo.jp/ Niconico Encyclopedia] (ニコニコ大百科) (2)  &nbsp;requires a letter, a backslash "/", and the ending url content for a nico article.
: <code>http://dic.nicovideo.jp/<u>v/sm1097445</u></code>
: <code>https://dic.nicovideo.jp/<u>a/みくみくにしてあげる♪</u></code>

; <code>vocadb =</code>
: [http://vocadb.net/ Vocaloid Database]  &nbsp;requires the ending url number.
: <code>http://vocadb.net/S/<u>1355</u></code>
: Adding a number after <code>vocadb# =</code> will recreate more links.
: Adding ' ok ' will hide section.

; <code>p      = yes</code>
: If this parameter is present the VocaDB link changes to point to a Producer page instead of Song pages. ''For producer pages only''.

; <code>a      = yes</code>
: If this parameter is present the VocaDB link changes to point to an Album page instead of Song pages. ''For album pages only''.

; <code>utaitedb =</code>
: [http://utaitedb.net/ Utaite Database]  &nbsp;requires the ending url number.
: <code>http://utaitedb.net/S/<u>28956</u></code>

; <code>mgp   =</code>
: [https://zh.moegirl.org.cn Moegirlpedia] (萌娘百科)  &nbsp;requires the original title of the song.
: <code>https://zh.moegirl.org.cn/<u>权御天下</u></code>

; <code>pixiv   =</code>
: [http://dic.pixiv.net/a/ Pixiv Encyclopedia] (ピクシブ百科事典)  &nbsp;requires the original title of the song.
: <code>http://dic.pixiv.net/a/<u>みんなみくみくにしてあげる♪</u></code>

; <code>tag    =</code>
; <code>tag2   =</code>
; <code>tag3   =</code>
: [http://www.nicovideo.jp/tag/ Nicovideo]  &nbsp;requires a commonly used tag; spaces require underscoring.
: <code>http://www.nicovideo.jp/tag/<u>みくみくにしてあげる</u></code>

; <code>vlw    =</code>
: [https://vocaloidlyrics.fandom.com/wiki/ VOCALOID Lyrics Wiki]  &nbsp;requires the original title of the song.
: <code>https://vocaloidlyrics.fandom.com/wiki/<u>みくみくにしてあげる♪ (Miku Miku ni Shite Ageru♪)</u></code>

; <code>url    =</code>
: For extra miscellaneous urls.
: <code><nowiki>[</nowiki>https://example.com/ Example_title]</code>

==Examples==
<pre>
==External links==
===Official===
{{Official
  |web   = 
  |media = 
  |prchs = 
  |dwlds = 
  |url   = [url name]
}}

